# Hardening §H2 fixture: an attacker-controlled `-H` header value
# carries embedded ANSI escape bytes (clear-screen + cursor-home + SGR),
# a bare CR, and a Unicode RTLO override (U+202E). The renderer
# must scrub all of these into `<U+XXXX>` placeholders before the
# popover or TTY ever sees them — see render::escape.
-H
X-Evil: before[2J[Hmid[31mafterrtail
-H
X-Bidi: path/‮gpj.exe
https://example.test/
